# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Data 360 Inspector — .gitignore
#
# This local folder is the PRIVATE build workshop. If/when this repo is pushed,
# we must NOT leak either (a) the readable source, or (b) the FULL build that
# contains in-development Data Explorer + Segment code. The PUBLIC GitHub Pages
# repo (ljoshi30/datacloud-inspector) only ever gets the STRIPPED install.html
# renamed to index.html — nothing else.
#
# See STRUCTURE.md for the full picture.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# OS / editor junk
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Local archive of one-off probes / tests / abandoned v0 approach (not product)
_archive/

# ── DO NOT PUBLISH: FULL build artifacts (contain in-dev Explorer + Segment) ──
# These are local-only. Keeping them out of git prevents accidental leaks of
# features that are still in development.
install-full.html
Data360-Inspector-FULL-internal.html
console-decorate-full.min.js
bookmarklet-full.txt

# Built zips
*.zip

# NOTE: console-decorate.js (the readable source) is intentionally NOT ignored
# here so it stays version-controlled in THIS private repo. Do NOT push this
# repo to a PUBLIC remote — only the separate datacloud-inspector Pages repo is
# public, and it receives ONLY the stripped install.html (as index.html).
.synccheck/
